co=dict(company_id='cmp_2fe2e646-d117-4d7f-9262-3b85673da2c5',products=products,evidence=[a],status='partial',coverage_note='31 current robotic offerings: 28 exact manipulator models, FD19 controller and two explicit integrated packages. Packages overlap arms; no invented variants. Obvious payload errors in official table not propagated. Partial: wafer/flat-panel transfer robots, semiconductor RF power systems, sensors, positioners, AMRs, robot software, earlier FD families and storage products remain for review.')
